OL,3,AShakespeare chief threatens to resign
OL,4,Aover Birmingham move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of the Shakespeare
OL,7,FInstitute has said he will resign if
OL,8,Fplans to move the centre from
OL,9,FStratford-upon-Avon to Birmingham go
OL,10,Fahead.
OL,12,FProfessor Michael Dobson said he was
OL,13,F"very unhappy" with the University of
OL,14,FBirmingham's decision to relocate the
OL,15,Fpostgraduate research institute from
OL,16,Fits historic home at Mason Croft to the
OL,17,Funiversity's Edgbaston campus in
OL,18,FSeptember 2027.
OL,20,F"Stratford has been the place where
OL,21,Fpeople come to dream of Shakespeare
OL,22,Fsince the 18th Century," he said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
