OL,5,G1345 For Pity's Sake
OL,6,     F1/8. A boy is sent away to a
OL,7,     Fspecial school for disabled
OL,8,     Fchildren, only to discover upon
OL,9,     Fleaving at 16, that he has a lot
OL,10,     Fmore to offer the world than he's
OL,11,     Fbeen told.
OL,12,G1400 The Archers
OL,13,     FKirsty makes a big decision, and
OL,14,     FNeil feels the weight of
OL,15,     Fresponsibility.
OL,16,G1415 Charles Paris: Dead Giveaway
OL,17,     F3/4. Charles is playing a butler
OL,18,     Fin a reality show set on a remote
OL,19,     Fisland. His list of suspects for
OL,20,     Fwho murdered the show's host,
OL,21,     Fcontroversial comic Sean Mckay, is
OL,22,     Fshortening.
